\@writefile{toc}{\contentsline {subsection}{\numberline {6.7.2}\texttt  {\hyphenchar \font =-1 super\_block} 与 \texttt  {\hyphenchar \font =-1 inode\_ops}}{82}{subsection.6.7.2}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{RF1}{83}
\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {6.7}{\ignorespaces Linux 文件系统各核心数据结构之间的引用关系。左半是文件系统侧：\texttt  {\hyphenchar \font =-1 file\_system\_type} 描述一种文件系统，把它的每个实例（\texttt  {\hyphenchar \font =-1 super\_block}）用 \texttt  {\hyphenchar \font =-1 s\_instances} 串成链，\texttt  {\hyphenchar \font =-1 s\_type} 指回类型；一个 \texttt  {\hyphenchar \font =-1 super\_block} 通过 \texttt  {\hyphenchar \font =-1 s\_inodes} 挂起该文件系统内所有内存 \texttt  {\hyphenchar \font =-1 inode}，块设备上的文件系统还有 \texttt  {\hyphenchar \font =-1 s\_bdev} 指向 \texttt  {\hyphenchar \font =-1 block\_device}。每个 \texttt  {\hyphenchar \font =-1 inode} 用 \texttt  {\hyphenchar \font =-1 i\_sb} 指回所属超级块、\texttt  {\hyphenchar \font =-1 i\_mapping} 指向 \texttt  {\hyphenchar \font =-1 address\_space}（页缓存）。右半是目录与进程侧：\texttt  {\hyphenchar \font =-1 dentry} 是路径中的一个目录项，\texttt  {\hyphenchar \font =-1 d\_inode} 指向 \texttt  {\hyphenchar \font =-1 inode}，\texttt  {\hyphenchar \font =-1 d\_parent}/\texttt  {\hyphenchar \font =-1 d\_subdirs}/\texttt  {\hyphenchar \font =-1 d\_child} 把目录项连成树，\texttt  {\hyphenchar \font =-1 d\_alias} 让同一 \texttt  {\hyphenchar \font =-1 inode} 的多个硬链接挂在一条链上；\texttt  {\hyphenchar \font =-1 path} 把挂载点 \texttt  {\hyphenchar \font =-1 vfsmount} 与 \texttt  {\hyphenchar \font =-1 dentry} 配对。\texttt  {\hyphenchar \font =-1 task\_struct} 经 \texttt  {\hyphenchar \font =-1 fs} 指向 \texttt  {\hyphenchar \font =-1 fs\_struct}（保存 \texttt  {\hyphenchar \font =-1 root}、\texttt  {\hyphenchar \font =-1 pwd} 两个 \texttt  {\hyphenchar \font =-1 path}），经 \texttt  {\hyphenchar \font =-1 files} 指向 \texttt  {\hyphenchar \font =-1 files\_struct}，后者用 \texttt  {\hyphenchar \font =-1 fdt} 指向 \texttt  {\hyphenchar \font =-1 fdtable}，\texttt  {\hyphenchar \font =-1 fd[i]} 数组的每一项指向一个打开的 \texttt  {\hyphenchar \font =-1 file}；\texttt  {\hyphenchar \font =-1 file} 再用 \texttt  {\hyphenchar \font =-1 f\_path}、\texttt  {\hyphenchar \font =-1 f\_mapping} 分别指回 \texttt  {\hyphenchar \font =-1 path}、\texttt  {\hyphenchar \font =-1 address\_space}（\texttt  {\hyphenchar \font =-1 f\_op} 指向的 \texttt  {\hyphenchar \font =-1 file\_operations} 操作表未单独画框）。本项目把这张图简化成表\nobreakspace  {}\ref  {tab:vfs-linux} 里的那几样：没有 \texttt  {\hyphenchar \font =-1 dentry} 缓存，\texttt  {\hyphenchar \font =-1 file\_operations} 与 \texttt  {\hyphenchar \font =-1 inode\_operations} 合并为一张 \texttt  {\hyphenchar \font =-1 inode\_ops}。\relax }}{83}{figure.caption.49}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:vfs-structs}{{6.7}{83}{Linux 文件系统各核心数据结构之间的引用关系。左半是文件系统侧：\code {file\_system\_type} 描述一种文件系统，把它的每个实例（\code {super\_block}）用 \code {s\_instances} 串成链，\code {s\_type} 指回类型；一个 \code {super\_block} 通过 \code {s\_inodes} 挂起该文件系统内所有内存 \code {inode}，块设备上的文件系统还有 \code {s\_bdev} 指向 \code {block\_device}。每个 \code {inode} 用 \code {i\_sb} 指回所属超级块、\code {i\_mapping} 指向 \code {address\_space}（页缓存）。右半是目录与进程侧：\code {dentry} 是路径中的一个目录项，\code {d\_inode} 指向 \code {inode}，\code {d\_parent}/\code {d\_subdirs}/\code {d\_child} 把目录项连成树，\code {d\_alias} 让同一 \code {inode} 的多个硬链接挂在一条链上；\code {path} 把挂载点 \code {vfsmount} 与 \code {dentry} 配对。\code {task\_struct} 经 \code {fs} 指向 \code {fs\_struct}（保存 \code {root}、\code {pwd} 两个 \code {path}），经 \code {files} 指向 \code {files\_struct}，后者用 \code {fdt} 指向 \code {fdtable}，\code {fd[i]} 数组的每一项指向一个打开的 \code {file}；\code {file} 再用 \code {f\_path}、\code {f\_mapping} 分别指回 \code {path}、\code {address\_space}（\code {f\_op} 指向的 \code {file\_operations} 操作表未单独画框）。本项目把这张图简化成表~\ref {tab:vfs-linux} 里的那几样：没有 \code {dentry} 缓存，\code {file\_operations} 与 \code {inode\_operations} 合并为一张 \code {inode\_ops}。\relax }{figure.caption.49}{}}
